  "javaNotes": "m18 'Infinite Void' (Gojo Satoru's domain), example proposal for design infinite-void-2026-11-02. Same mount as m10-r2 (pitch +8, y -16): on the PoseStack translate to the head pivot, mulPose XP(8), then YP(turn), scale(pulse); never put pitch and turn on one ModelPart. Core = 4 overlapping void cubes (black ball, reach 2.2) that stays still; glints (6 white specks on a 35-degree ring at r 2.1) drift at 20 deg/s. Infinity shell = two vertical 8-segment rings (tiltX 90, r 3.4, blue/cyan alternating) turning about Y at 12 deg/s, so they sweep a sphere. Six Eyes = 6 white eye slits with blue irises facing outwards at r 4.3, -6 deg/s. Dark abyss disc r 6.6 (16 plates, not glowing) under three tilted information streams: red r 5.2 tiltX 20 (+30 deg/s, spin 1), cyan streaks r 8.2 tiltZ -25 (spin -1, -18 deg/s), violet diamonds r 10.6 tiltX -12/tiltZ 18 (+10 deg/s). Blue and Red orbs at r 12.6 on opposite sides (+14 deg/s, bob 0.6 over 3.6 s / 4.2 s), 12 far stars at r 14.2-14.6 (bob 0.4). 122 boxes, 102 glowing (only the core and the disc, 20 boxes, are lit normally). Top about 0.8 block above the head (outer stream), nothing enters the head cylinder (lowest point of the tilted streams is more than 8 units out from the axis). In the mod this would be a 9th look (wheel_skins/infinite_void.json, a verbatim copy) only after approval.",
  "animationNotesRu": "Каждый этап поворачивает потоки на 45 градусов, а без щелчков всё движется само: красный поток делает оборот за 12 секунд, голубой — против него за 20, фиолетовый — за 36. Сфера «Бесконечности» медленно обходит шар, шесть глаз плывут навстречу, «Синий» и «Красный» облетают домен и покачиваются. Чёрный шар стоит на месте."
}
